WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.869
Your own machines are free.

2
00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:05.361
You only need cSats for the network.

3
00:00:06.361 --> 00:00:08.558
This estimate uses live prices.

4
00:00:08.558 --> 00:00:11.819
Choose how many calls a day, and a model size.

5
00:00:11.819 --> 00:00:14.229
It shows roughly what you'd spend.

6
00:00:15.229 --> 00:00:17.917
Bigger models cost more per call.

7
00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:19.547
One cSat is one sat.

8
00:00:20.547 --> 00:00:24.451
When you're ready, fund your account with Lightning, from the wallet page.

9
00:00:25.451 --> 00:00:27.149
Bots have a daily budget.

10
00:00:27.149 --> 00:00:30.003
So a bot never spends more than you allow.

11
00:00:31.003 --> 00:00:33.245
Only using your own machines?

12
00:00:33.245 --> 00:00:34.404
Skip this step.
